<div class="card en" lang="en"><h2>English</h2><p>School PDF processes images locally into PDFs without consumer accounts. Use and share only documents you have permission to process. Review exported PDFs and keep your own backups; scan accuracy depends on the source image. Local files can be lost when the app is uninstalled or data is erased, and previously exported copies are not deleted by the app.</p><p>For privacy and deletion, see the <a href="{{ url('/privacy') }}">privacy policy</a> and <a href="{{ url('/data-deletion') }}">data deletion instructions</a>. Official contact: <a href="mailto:{{ config('schoolpdf.support_email') }}">{{ config('schoolpdf.support_email') }}</a>. Final legal review and publisher legal-entity confirmation are required before commercial launch.</p></div>
